# Phase 5 lifecycle (U3): a relative HOME that names a folder the workspace
# holds. fx v0.0.16 treats it as unset (21a55a45) and saves nothing in it;
# xfx before U3 made `~/.xfx` there. One prompt, so a session store or a
# prompt history that kept it leaves a file `workls` lists. `homedir`, not
# `home`: scripts/fxcap/redact.py rewrites any `/home/...` as a local path.
work p5-relhome-made
gateway p5-relhome-made-turns.json
env HOME=relative/homedir
keep
wait 3
snap h00-launch
type hello
key Enter
wait 3
snap h01-turn
type /quit
key Enter
wait 2
relaunch sessions
wait 4
snapfull h02-sessions
workls h03
